# Dashboard Module Rules

You are assigned exclusively to the **Dashboard & Analytics** module workspace.

## Scope & Isolation
- Your work is strictly confined to `src/modules/dashboard/`.
- **CRITICAL:** Do not read, write, or modify code inside `entities`, `reports`, or `config` modules.
- Use data from `entities` only by importing shared TypeScript interfaces from `@/interfaces/entities.ts`.

## UI & Widgets
- Wrap all analytic widgets and charts inside PrimeVue `<Card>` components.
- Use PrimeVue `Chart` (Chart.js wrapper) or compatible visualization blocks.

## Development & Testing
- Implement and test features inside `src/modules/dashboard/views/Sandbox.vue`.
- Access this isolated testing playground locally via the `/dev/dashboard` route.
- Mock all analytic and aggregation endpoints inside `src/mocks/handlers/dashboard.ts`.
